Two-period game with endogenous period-2 effort (strength K^r2 * f). Direct symmetric SPE intensity e* vs the
reduced-form e(theta(lambda_red)) [rivals' strategies fixed, as in Prop 2.2(3)] and e(theta(lambda_full)) [rivals respond].
Analytic prediction for r_f=1 Tullock: lambda_full/lambda_red = 2(n-1)/n (rivals are discouraged by a stronger field).
