Reading: the first-order structure (objective pi_i + lambda(pi_i - mean)) survives in the full game, but lambda is the
full derivative dV_i/dK_i, not the reduced one. Here the strategic term is positive (rivals reduce effort), so the reduced
form UNDERSTATES the price of standing by a factor approaching 2 as n grows; with a different period-2 technology the sign
of the correction can differ. The reduced form is exact only for n=2 in this technology.
